OL,3,AOpenAI says it cracked 90-year-old
OL,4,Amaths problem in 88 hours
OL,5,
OL,6,FOpenAI says it has found a solution to
OL,7,Fa decades-old advanced maths problem in
OL,8,Fa matter of hours using a new
OL,9,Fartificial intelligence (AI) model and
OL,10,Fthousands of AI bots.
OL,12,FThe ChatGPT-maker said on Tuesday that
OL,13,Fby focusing a group of roughly 10,000
OL,14,FAI agents, or AI bots that undertake
OL,15,Ftasks somewhat autonomously, it solved
OL,16,Fa notoriously difficult maths problem
OL,17,Fin just 88 hours.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,109,105,200,160,0,100
