CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1788911657
OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AOpenAI says it cracked 90-year-old
OL,4,Amaths problem in 88 hours
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe problem was part of the
OL,7,FNavier-Stokes equations, which concern
OL,8,Fhow fluids move. For 90 years important
OL,9,Faspects of the problems have lacked a
OL,10,Fproof, the argument underlying a
OL,11,Fcorrect math equation.
OL,13,FOpenAI called the solution which it
OL,14,Ffound a "milestone" and evidence that
OL,15,FAI tools are improving quickly.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/19
